## 1. Instrument and notation

Ray coordinates as charged (17(vvvvv) §2), unchanged:

```text
R_4 = { (n,m; M2',V2'; k) = (3K,2K; 3K-6; K-1; 4) : K >= 4 },  (x,y) = (gamma,pi)
