   123	K  b=K-2  beta_b                         h vars  lower beta vars  geom params  light GB vars
   124	7  5      mu*y^4*(y-x)                   27      15               43           44
   125	8  6      mu*y^5*(y-x)                   35      21               57           58
   126	9  7      mu*y^6*(y-x)                   44      28               73           74
   127	```
   128	
   129	`light GB vars` includes `mu_inv`. The full theorem-cut variant adds one more
   130	variable, `lambda`, so its GB variable counts are 45, 59, 75.
   131	
   132	The row formation counts were:
   324	```
