   331	
   332	The requested promotion chain would be:
   333	
   334	```text
   335	K=7 pinned row UNIT
   336	K=8 pinned D=108 no-split row UNIT
   337	K=9 pinned (99,66) case A row UNIT
   338	  => UNSPLIT-CONFIGURATION LEMMA holds at K=7,8,9
   339	  => case (A) of (99,66) DEAD
   340	  => with banked (B),(C), (99,66) skeleton verdict COMPLETE modulo N1
   341	  => D=108 no-split DEAD, hence D=108 CLOSED at skeleton level
   342	  => delta_1'=0 row (21,14) DEAD
   343	  => NOTIFY-WORTHY
