   345	
   346	This chain is not activated. Only the K=7 premise is discharged by this lane.
   347	The K=8 and K=9 premises remain undecided:
   348	
   349	```text
   350	K=7: UNIT_IDEAL_CHAR0
   351	K=8: INCONCLUSIVE_TIMEOUT / execution-killed variants, no Q certificate
   352	K=9: INCONCLUSIVE_TIMEOUT / full theorem formation timeout, no Q certificate
   353	```
   354	
   355	Final lane verdict:
   356	
   357	```text
   358	K=7 pinned nonconstant arm: DEAD on this pinned residual chart.
   359	K=8 D=108 no-split pinned row: OPEN/TIMEOUT.
   360	K=9 (99,66) case (A) pinned row: OPEN/TIMEOUT.
   361	UNSPLIT-CONFIGURATION LEMMA at K=7,8,9: NOT PROVED.
   362	D=108 skeleton closure: NOT OBTAINED.
   363	(99,66) skeleton complete modulo N1: NOT OBTAINED.
   364	NOTIFY-WORTHY: false.
   365	```
   366	
   367	## 9. Run ledger and containment notes
   368	
   390	literal Singular certificate that `reduce(1,G)==0` after the controlled
   391	standard-basis computation.
   392	
   393	The containment point used for K=7 is:
   394	
   395	```text
   396	I_light = < J rows, LEVEL-4 rho rows, CSTP-1, mu*mu_inv-1 >
   397	I_full  = I_light + < theorem cutoff rows >
   398	1 in I_light  =>  1 in I_full
   399	```
   400	
   401	So the K=7 light unit is stronger than needed for the full theorem-valid pinned
   402	chart. The converse is not used: K=8/K=9 light timeouts do not say the full
   403	ideals are nonunit, and K=8 full SIGKILL does not say either unit or nonunit.
   404	
   405	The exact-Q failure classes are separated:
   406	
   407	```text
   408	INCONCLUSIVE_TIMEOUT: guided_gb wrapper timed out after std began and wrote timed_out=true.
   409	EXECUTION_KILLED: process returncode -9; no unit/dimension marker; treated as no certificate.
   410	FORMATION_TIMEOUT: prelude did not reach PRE__ROWS_FINAL; treated as no formed ideal.
   411	```
   412	
   413	Only `INCONCLUSIVE_TIMEOUT` appears in the main K=8/K=9 light exact runs. The
   414	K=8 full theorem-cut exact run is `EXECUTION_KILLED`. The K=9 full theorem-cut
   415	attempt is `FORMATION_TIMEOUT`.
   416	
   417	## 10. Artifact paths
   418	
   419	```text
   420	box/k4raypinned-20260903/pinned_chart.py
   421	box/k4raypinned-20260903/summary-all.json
   422	box/k4raypinned-20260903/runs/MAIN_K7_PIN_LIGHT2/summary.json
