   413	      including K = 7, 8, 9.  This DOES bite on the open rows — it is the only
   414	      statement in this report that does.
   415	CHART EMPTINESS (§5)         — K = 4, 5 only, and only for deg β ≤ K−1.
   416	```
   417	
   418	So the correct summary of the campaign position is: **the ray is not closed, one
