+## Algebraic conventions and maps
+
+Put `L=y-x`, `b=K-2`, and
+
+```text
+H = y^(K-1)L,
+beta_b = P = mu*y^(K-3)L,
+f = h^2 + 2 beta,
+g = h^3 + 3 beta*h + (3/2) alpha,
