+| F_32009 | 0.114102 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all zero |
+| F_32027 | 0.114111 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all zero |
+
+Those three rows are only `UNIT_IN_EVERY_REQUESTED_FIBRE__FP_ONLY`. The
