+| charged K=5, b=4 | `UNIT_IDEAL_CHAR0`, 137 rows | 0.114120 s | charged low-K empty calibration |
+| tame `h=y-x`, `beta=mu*x` | nonunit, dim 0, vector-space length 2 | 0.007878 s | a nonempty tame chart survives; exact `J=6*x*mu^2` varies |
+| Hilbert-hint main run | accepted, dim 0, length 3640 | 1.015288 s | prediction and computed length agree |
+| perturbed hint | rejected despite computed length 3640 | same call | target mismatch is detected |
+
+For every unit control, `reduce(I,G)=0` and all required output markers are
