+  }
+' "$receipt" > "$manifest"
+sha256sum -c "$manifest"
+```
+
+All nine entries returned `OK`. The same generated manifest was checked a
+second time, also with nine `OK` results. In receipt order the verified
+digests are:
+
+```text
+db150d8b078b9626348dd75dc21f966b20671e070e2c2349c1224bf2a46f130f  k4ray-pinned-chart-gpt55-20260903.md
+2befb3cac8e51305e65ab0e48de485a7098ba104a3620d8b174927791a896a2a  k4ray-degree-tower-opus5-20260903.md
