+### Modular screen and mandatory exact replay
+
+The weighted order is degree-reverse-lexicographic by the positive tower
+weights (`wp` in Singular), with the highest-weight lower-band variables first
+and `mu_inv` last. Using one thread, the full reduced prefix returned:
+
+| field | wall in standard-basis call | unit | basis size | dim | normal forms |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| F_32003 | 0.114422 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all 61 rows reduce to zero |
+| F_32009 | 0.114102 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all zero |
+| F_32027 | 0.114111 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all zero |
+
+Those three rows are only `UNIT_IN_EVERY_REQUESTED_FIBRE__FP_ONLY`. The
