+### Modular screen and mandatory exact replay
+
+The weighted order is degree-reverse-lexicographic by the positive tower
+weights (`wp` in Singular), with the highest-weight lower-band variables first
+and `mu_inv` last. Using one thread, the full reduced prefix returned:
