+## Limitations
+
+The computations prove emptiness of necessary reduced subsystems, so an exact
+unit is decisive. Conversely, positive dimension of one of these subsystems
+would not prove survival of the full Jacobian chart. No modular properness
+argument is available for the inhomogeneous localization. The separate
+charged tower-induction and total-degree-beta obligations remain outside this
+lane's compute mandate; skeleton promotions below are in the charged
+pinned/tower scope and, for `(99,66)`, retain the stated `modulo N1` qualifier.

