+actual-rho matches, total degrees 10..1     51 rows
+mu*mu_inv-1                                 1 global row
+```
+
+There are 61 band rows and 62 generators after the global localizer. The
+cleared-denominator LCM is `424320`; none of its prime divisors is among the
+three probe primes. The durable identities are
