+- K=8, D=108 no-split `(24,16; 18; 7; 4)`, b=6;
+- K=9, case (A) of `(99,66)`, `(27,18; 21; 8; 4)`, b=7.
+
+Only an exact-Q unit certificate closes a row as dead.  Positive-dimensional
+output is followed by point extraction and an exact Jacobian test.  Finite-field
+unit output is used only as a screen and is never promoted directly.
