+
+| field | wall in standard-basis call | unit | basis size | dim | normal forms |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| F_32003 | 0.114422 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all 61 rows reduce to zero |
+| F_32009 | 0.114102 s | yes | 1 | -1 | all zero |
