+checked. The three primes `32003,32009,32027` divide neither denominator LCM.
+
+The standard-basis ring uses the 36 serialized variables in decreasing
+positive tower weight and `mu_inv` last, with Singular `wp`, i.e. the requested
+weighted degree-reverse-lexicographic order. No Hilbert-length hint is needed
+for a unit computation: the acceptance test is the stronger literal
+`reduce(1,G)=0`, plus normal-form and marker checks.
+
+### Branch verdicts
+
+The decisive full prefixes include the last positive-remainder match
+`D_13=q_2/3`. The first two diagnostic finite-field prefixes were nonunit;
+later attempted prefixes hit their 60-second caps. No minimal-killing-band
+claim is therefore made. The complete reduced prefixes give:
+
+| internal split | field | standard-basis wall | basis | dim | accepted |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| A | F_32003 | 5.726070 s | 1 | -1 | yes |
+| A | F_32009 | 5.530639 s | 1 | -1 | yes |
+| A | F_32027 | 5.625695 s | 1 | -1 | yes |
+| A | **Q** | **11.087997 s** | **1** | **-1** | **yes** |
+| B | F_32003 | 8.030455 s | 1 | -1 | yes |
+| B | F_32009 | 7.979869 s | 1 | -1 | yes |
+| B | F_32027 | 7.980635 s | 1 | -1 | yes |
+| B | **Q** | **27.618173 s** | **1** | **-1** | **yes** |
+
+Every run has `returncode=0`, `timed_out=false`, `missing_markers=[]`, and
+`nf_all_zero=true`. The exact A script contains 97 ordered generators (96 band
+rows plus the localizer) and exactly 97 zero normal-form checks; the exact B
+script analogously has 99 and 99. Their exact script/stdout hashes are
