+  => D=108 CLOSED at skeleton level.
+
+K=9 internal split A reduced necessary ideal = (1)
+and K=9 internal split B reduced necessary ideal = (1)
+and {internal A, internal B} is an exhaustive cover
+  => K=9 nonconstant pinned row DEAD
+  => case (A) of (99,66) DEAD
+  => with banked configurations (B) and (C),
+     (99,66) SKELETON VERDICT COMPLETE for all three configurations modulo N1.
+```
+
+Final row verdicts:
+
+```text
