+box/k4rayk89-20260903/topprobe-artifacts/kuniform-rec3/K10K11_REC3_V1/audit.json
+box/k4rayk89-20260903/authoritative-seal-sol56/authoritative-artifacts.sha256
+box/k4rayk89-20260903/authoritative-seal-sol56/k8-d108-closed-summary.json
+```
+
+The independent K=8/K=9 audit has SHA-256
+`52d0ac2e30701f85dc4bc1bf329ea4bc58417566555c8e681ac6ab0d3339ad3b`;
+the K=10/K=11 recurrence audit has SHA-256
+`eec5e548a007ba8eb8fc7ce362c407b23601db7c007b954184398d371e0f977f`.
+Its checker has SHA-256
+`ea0a5f859c0a0263367876de475d346591dc9affd8523f59dd7e2ee535d945b9`.
+The authoritative K=8 promotion summary has SHA-256
+`ea9faf59b240d2d02f2cbc940cae2c254cc8e32cb9bfceeb37e4262c036aae99`.
+The authoritative 95-file manifest has SHA-256
+`4c14d0c832a85a82333ed2030ff3305b6eb43bbdd12013637b196d15f8cc2d4f`;
+an independent `sha256sum -c` returned 95/95 `OK`, recorded in a verification
+JSON with SHA-256
+`09c3c00de8281e287e280544a785167847485819cb27480db3cd8145498a268d`.
+Invalid and timed-out diagnostics are excluded from that manifest and listed
+separately.
+
+The standard-basis scripts are generated through the frozen
+`box/lib/guided_gb.py`; staged row files and their union checksums are generated
+through `box/lib/staged_band_emitter.py`. Solver invocations set
+`OMP_NUM_THREADS=OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=MKL_NUM_THREADS=NUMEXPR_NUM_THREADS=1`
+and use Singular's one-CPU/one-thread flags. Every authoritative driver and
+internal CAS call has an external timeout with a kill grace period. At most
+four lane calls ran concurrently, within the five-core ceiling.
+One developmental Hensel audit was inadvertently started without its outer
+timeout, detected, and manually terminated; no output from it enters any
+certificate or authoritative manifest.
