+box/k4rayk89-20260903/authoritative-seal-sol56/authoritative-artifacts.sha256
+box/k4rayk89-20260903/authoritative-seal-sol56/k8-d108-closed-summary.json
+```
+
+The independent K=8/K=9 audit has SHA-256
