+the K=10/K=11 recurrence audit has SHA-256
+`eec5e548a007ba8eb8fc7ce362c407b23601db7c007b954184398d371e0f977f`.
+Its checker has SHA-256
+`ea0a5f859c0a0263367876de475d346591dc9affd8523f59dd7e2ee535d945b9`.
